      "value": "@{5d21c1a8154b187933d51a3e|full_name}: Weird. I mean, I've learned to work around it at this point, but that's odd that cut-off is more costly on the GPU than alpha blending.\nWonder if a firmware update for the GPU could resolve something like that or offer something to work with for other developers.",
      "viewerReactions": null
